ll spam this error every frame:\r\n\r\n```\r\nWARNING: Could not create 3D MSAA framebuffer, status: 36054\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis goes back to when stencil support was added to Godot. Over a year ago, I made #108943 to fix WebXR after the stencil changes, but it only fixed it when not using MSAA (and, I guess I didn't test with MSAA)\r\n\r\nBack on that PR, @BastiaanOlij even [asked](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108943#pullrequestreview-3053834187) if it was OK that the PR hard-coded `true` for `p_has_depth_stencil` in a couple of cases. And, it was OK in one case! But not the case where we render directly to an MSAA render target given to us by WebXR, which is what this PR fixes","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repi